# Mis-pathed duplicate Prisma client (debt #8): a stray `prisma generate` run
# from the wrong cwd resolves `output = "../generated/prisma"` to a doubly-nested
# `generated/generated/` (~22MB dup). Ignore it so it can't recur. NOTE: this is
# deliberately the doubly-nested path only — do NOT use the over-broad
# `**/generated/`, which would also exclude the REAL client at src/generated/prisma.
generated/generated/
**/src/generated/generated/

